  },
  {
   "source": "ent:Parameter:bubble morphology",
   "target": "ent:Parameter:bubble size and shape",
   "type": "HAS_PROPERTY",
   "modality": "text",
   "kind": "triple",
   "doc": "Froth_Images_from_Flotation_Laboratory_Test_in_Magotteaux_Cell_data_08_00069",
   "text": "and in studies of bubble morphology and algorithms for estimating bubble size and shape,"
  },
  {
   "source": "onto:FrothFlotation",
   "target": "ent:Parameter:volume of the cell",
   "type": "HAS_ENTITIES",
   "kind": "onto_link"
  },
  {
   "source": "onto:FrothFlotation",
   "target": "ent:Parameter:labels",
   "type": "HAS_ENTITIES",
   "kind": "onto_link"
  },
  {
   "source": "ent:Parameter:volume of the cell",
   "target": "ent:RawOre:mass of 1.800 g of mineral",
   "type": "KEEPS",
   "modality": "text",
   "kind": "triple",
   "doc": "Froth_Images_from_Flotation_Laboratory_Test_in_Magotteaux_Cell_data_08_00069",
   "text": "To achieve the cp condition, considering the volume of the cell, a mass of 1.800 g of mineral,"
  },
  {
   "source": "onto:Concentrate",
   "target": "ent:Product:recovery",
   "type": "HAS_ENTITIES",
   "kind": "onto_link"
  },
  {
   "source": "ent:Product:recovery",
   "target": "ent:Product:mineral of interest",
   "type": "DECREASES",
   "modality": "text",
   "kind": "triple",
   "doc": "Froth_Images_from_Flotation_Laboratory_Test_in_Magotteaux_Cell_data_08_00069",
   "text": "which may reduce the recovery of the mineral of interest."
  },
  {
   "source": "ent:Parameter:labels",
   "target": "ent:Product:behaviors",
   "type": "CAUSES",
   "modality": "text",
   "kind": "triple",
   "doc": "Froth_Images_from_Flotation_Laboratory_Test_in_Magotteaux_Cell_data_08_00069",
   "text": "due to the appreciable differences behind these labels."
  },
  {
   "source": "onto:FrothFlotation",
   "target": "ent:Reagent:method",
   "type": "HAS_ENTITIES",
   "kind": "onto_link"
  },
  {
   "source": "ent:Reagent:method",
   "target": "ent:Reagent:compact variogram characterization",
   "type": "USES",
   "modality": "text",
   "kind": "triple",
   "doc": "Froth_Images_from_Flotation_Laboratory_Test_in_Magotteaux_Cell_data_08_00069",
   "text": "a method based on compact variogram characterization [ 7 ,"
  },
  {
   "source": "ent:ProcessStage:scavenger circuit",
   "target": "ent:Reagent:frother",
   "type": "USES",
   "modality": "text",
   "kind": "triple",
   "doc": "Froth_Images_from_Flotation_Laboratory_Test_in_Magotteaux_Cell_data_08_00069",
   "text": "frother and depressant addition on the copper recovery and concentrate grade of the nchanga underground scavenger circuit of Konkola copper mine-Zambia."
  },
  {
   "source": "ent:ProcessStage:scavenger circuit",
   "target": "ent:Reagent:depressant",
   "type": "USES",
   "modality": "text",
